Here’s a .gitignore tailored for a LaTeX project located in the doc/ directory.
This ignores auxiliary, log, and temporary files generated by LaTeX compilers, but not your main .tex files or images.

Usage:

    Place this .gitignore in your repository root.
    Only auxiliary/temp/built files inside doc/ or subfolders will be ignored.
    Your .tex, image, and source files will remain tracked.

Let me know if you want to customize further (e.g. keep PDFs, ignore other file types, etc)!

